</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#8220;Memorandum and Articles
of Association&#8221; means the Company&#8217;s Amended and Restated Memorandum and Articles of Association, as and restated on July 4,
