</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#8220;NewGenIvf&#8221; means
NewGenIvf Group Limited, a British Virgin Islands business company, the surviving entity of the Business Combination, unless the context
