in the table as follows:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;"> <tr style="vertical-align: bottom"> <td style="white-space: nowrap; width: 21%; border-bottom: black 1.5pt solid"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Name</b></span></td> <td style="white-space: nowrap; width: 1%">&#160;</td> <td style="white-space: nowrap; width: 30%; border-bottom: black 1.5pt solid; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Background</b></span></td> <td style="white-space: nowrap; width: 1%">&#160;</td> <td style="white-space: nowrap; width: 8%; border-bottom: black 1.5pt solid; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Ownership %</b></span></td> <td style="white-space: nowrap; width: 1%">&#160;</td> <td style="white-space: nowrap; width: 38%; border-bottom: black 1.5pt solid; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Principal activity</b></span></td></tr> <tr style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #CCEEFF"> <td style="padding-left: 9pt; text-indent: -9pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">NewGenivf Limited</span></td> <td style="white-space: nowrap">&#160;</td> <td> <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c88" name="us-gaap:SubsidiaryOfLimitedLiabilityCompanyOrLimitedPartnershipState" id="ixv-15333"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt">&#9679;&#160;&#160;&#160;A Cayman Islands company</p> <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt">&#9679;&#160;&#160;&#160;Incorporated on 16 January, 2019</p></ix:nonNumeric></td> <td style="white-space: nowrap">&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:no