the&#160;years ended December 31, 2024 and 2023 were $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-20708">19,502</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c6" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-20709">31,173</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p>

