  </table></ix:nonNumeric>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;&#160;</p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="srt:ScheduleOfCondensedFinancialStatementsTableTextBlock" id="ixv-18845"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">In addition to the transactions
and balances detailed elsewhere in these consolidated financial statements, the Company had the following transactions with related parties:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-spacing: 0px;">
