    <td style="width: 1%">&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: justify; width: 90%"><a href="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1981662/000121390025061753/ea024817101ex3-1_newgen.htm"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Amended and Restated Memorandum and Articles of Association of the Company dated July 4, 2025 (incorporated by reference to Exhibit 3.1 of the Company&#8217;s Form 6-K filed with the SEC on July 7, 2025)</span></a></td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: top; background-color: White">
